# Copy to .env (gitignored) to point EVERY game, addon and map repository at another CDN at once, with no per-repo edit.
# The site root; "/content" is added. Order of precedence: --cdn / --from, $GS_CDN_URL, this file, the lock's own `origin`,
# DOT_CDN_URL and DOT_PACKS_FROM are the old names and still work.
# https://content.gamespice.net (formerly dotgames.org, still served). GS_PACKS_FROM=none fetches nothing; a folder path (or file:// URL) is a local copy of the CDN's content/ tree.
#GS_CDN_URL=https://dev.dotgames.org
